From 36da8e02b2e12f56ff3582770da2a34499d42613 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fanboy <fanboy@openwrt.org>
Date: Sat, 10 Jan 2026 09:58:15 -1000
Subject: [PATCH] Reliability and compatibility patches

Use github for more reliable feeds

subtle LED colors


bring down SPI freq to 33Mhz for better sysupgrade reliability

remove sound but explicitly configure CONFIG_SND_SOC_AN7581=n in config-6.18

colored banner

silence PHY LED pinctrl error message caused by GPS fix

quiet dropbear logs

wifi-scripts: fix "command failed: Not supported (-95)" error
